{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "F1SubsystemMountDropsJoinKeys",
    "description": "FINDING F1 (expected to FAIL at the pinned toolchain). Mounting a relational leaf as a NESTED §4.7 subsystem breaks its `join.on`.\n\nExpected diagnostic:\n  Compile failed: Unsupported feature 'value-equality join over data-derived columns': join key column 'left_key' does not resolve to a loop index of this aggregate\n\nWhat happens: the array runtime's subsystem mount renames each mounted variable to `<key>.<name>` and rewrites `Expr::Variable` references to match, but a `join.on` key column is a plain STRING on the aggregate node, not a child expression, so it is left naming the old bare name. The scalar flatten path gets this right (`flatten.rs::namespace_join_names`); the array path -- `simulate_array/compile.rs::mount_subsystems`, which renames through `rename_free_symbol`, an `Expr::Variable` walker over `map_children` -- has no mirror of it.\n\nWhy it matters here: every relational leaf this project will write joins on data columns, so under this defect NO calculator can be mounted as a nested subsystem. runs/micro_exhaust_run.esm therefore mounts its leaves as TOP-LEVEL `models` `{ref}` entries instead, where the leaf keeps its own flat namespace and a scoped name resolves as a key column.\n\nWhen this starts passing, the nested form becomes available and docs/esm-conventions.md §5 should be revisited -- the nested form is the one esm-spec §4.7 documents and the one that merges index sets.",
    "authors": ["EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"]
  },
  "index_sets": { "probe_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 } },
  "models": {
    "Host": {
      "variables": {
        "probe": { "type": "unknown", "shape": ["probe_rows"] },
        "doubled": { "type": "unknown" }
      },
      "equations": [
        { "lhs": "probe", "rhs": { "op": "const", "args": [], "value": [1, 2] } },
        { "lhs": "doubled", "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": [2.0, "Leaf.matchedPairCount"] } }
      ],
      "subsystems": { "Leaf": { "ref": "./join_leaf.esm" } },
      "tests": [
        { "id": "the_mounted_join_should_still_match",
          "description": "Should be 4 = 2 x 2. Fails to BUILD instead.",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0 },
          "assertions": [ { "variable": "doubled", "time": 0.0, "expected": 4.0 } ] }
      ]
    }
  }
}
